(drawio-editor), MIT licensed, and bundles draw.io v31.4.2, Apache-2.0 licensed.
Source: https://github.com/rcarmo/piclaw-addons and https://github.com/jgraph/drawio
Licenses and vendor provenance are included in packages/drawio/vendor/.
